        },
        {
          "text": "Ammalle nama 642, ka balbala Delaya, Tobiafi Nekoda, ka dira Tel-Mela, Tel-Harsha, Kerubu, Adani, Imeri keesaa galeti jira; ammo worri aka Israeli keesaa d'alate ufi agarsiisu dad'abe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "NEH.7.61+NEH.7.62",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "NEH.7.61",
              "NEH.7.62"
